OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader to stand down after
OL,4,Ahealth scares
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of Plymouth City Council
OL,7,Fwill stand down in 2027 amid health
OL,8,Fconcerns, he has announced.
OL,10,FTudor Evans has been leader of the
OL,11,FLabour group on the city council for 29
OL,12,Fyears and served five terms as council
OL,13,Fleader.
OL,15,FHe said it was time to "put health and
OL,16,Ffamily first" after 38 years in
OL,17,Fpolitics following "two health scares
OL,18,Fover the last three years". He added it
OL,19,Fwas a "difficult decision" as it played
OL,20,Fhad a big part in his life, and was one
OL,21,Fthat he had not "taken lightly", but
OL,22,Fadded that felt he had done his bit.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
