OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader to stand down after
OL,4,Ahealth scares
OL,5,
OL,6,FEvans has been a councillor for Ham
OL,7,Fward of Plymouth since 1988 and has led
OL,8,Fthe Labour group since 1998. He is due
OL,9,Fto remain leader until the elections in
OL,10,FMay 2027.
